      "writtenOn": "2017-06-12T01:54:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looking at the usage of MMFS, it seems to contain bits set for various fault status: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/master/core/cortex-m/panic.c#78",
